  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until browned, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add garlic, cumin, and paprika; cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add Shaoxing wine, if using, and cook, stirring to deglaze, for 1 minute.",
    "Add tomato paste, cooking, stirring constantly, for 2 minutes.",
    "Add kombu, if using, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add beans, diced tomatoes, salt, and pepper; stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Stir occasionally to prevent scorching.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro, if desired."
